## 📖 About The Project
This project is a fully functional Smart HR Dashboard built completely from scratch using **React, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS**. It uses custom JavaScript logic and Regular Expressions (Regex) to analyze text and calculate candidate matching scores right in the browser, without needing a backend server!

## ✨ Key Features
* 🧩 **Smart Entity Extractor:** Uses custom JavaScript search algorithms to instantly parse raw text and extract technical skills, programming languages, and frameworks.
* 📊 **Advanced Resume Matcher:** Compares a candidate's profile against a target Job Description.
* 🔍 **Skill Gap Analysis:** Mathematically calculates missing skills and provides visual feedback on exactly what the candidate needs to learn.
* 🎯 **Role Recommender:** Analyzes extracted profile data and calculates percentage fits for various industry roles.
* 🎨 **Modern UI/UX:** Built with React conditional rendering (`useState`) and custom CSS styling for a seamless, single-page application experience.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
* **Framework:** React.js (via Vite)
* **Language:** JavaScript (ES6+)
* **Structure & Design:** HTML5 & Custom CSS3
* **Deployment:** Netlify

